<title>USA: Dow Jones average gains more than 50 points.</title>
<headline>Dow Jones average gains more than 50 points.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average gained more than 50 points in early morning trading on Friday, boosted by comments by Federal Reserve Chairman Alan Greenspan.</p>
<p>At 9:37 a.m. EDT, the Dow was up 52.98 points at 7,189.60, which activated the New York Stock Exchange's limit on program trading.</p>
